{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/a40fc1fccdef903d3be312a162999794.avif?t=1755204420\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Landfall</i> is an exhilarating cooperative survival extraction game set in a vibrant low-poly world, where every decision counts and every moment is a test of your skills. Immerse yourself in a gameplay experience designed to be accessible to players of all skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/60437f75c12afab4ed8a30c4dd7635e6.poster.avif?t=1755204420\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/60437f75c12afab4ed8a30c4dd7635e6.webm?t=1755204420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/60437f75c12afab4ed8a30c4dd7635e6.mp4?t=1755204420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/2f62af6d29f961a68f1baa25faadc6a5.avif?t=1755204420\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into Dynamic Maps:</strong> Your mission is clear\u2014survive, loot, and escape from perilous foes in diverse environments. Engage in thrilling encounters with soldiers and zombies, each presenting unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/3b777ee68bfb7d20fc2a2583bb2a0f9e.avif?t=1755204420\" width=610 height=88 /></span><strong>Experience Fluid Parkour Gameplay!</strong> Leap, vault, and scale obstacles with ease in <i>Landfall</i>. Master the art of parkour to traverse the landscape dynamically, turning every environment into your playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/74362b37e9c29edf3ef460fd10242818.poster.avif?t=1755204420\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/74362b37e9c29edf3ef460fd10242818.webm?t=1755204420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/74362b37e9c29edf3ef460fd10242818.mp4?t=1755204420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/018f564fc16d440e5df4572271b0afd7.avif?t=1755204420\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Gameplay:</strong> With full controller support and adjustable difficulty levels for every map, <i>Landfall</i> caters to everyone, from beginners to seasoned players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/8c04a8f404594244fc96d2b1aebc393e.poster.avif?t=1755204420\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/8c04a8f404594244fc96d2b1aebc393e.webm?t=1755204420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/8c04a8f404594244fc96d2b1aebc393e.mp4?t=1755204420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/434de048edad0fd3a2696951761a8b06.avif?t=1755204420\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Controller Support:</strong> Experience seamless gameplay with complete controller compatibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Difficulty Levels:</strong> Tailor your experience to suit your skill level, ensuring fun for all players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Enemies:</strong> Face off against soldiers and zombies, each bringing distinct challenges to your survival quest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extraction System:</strong> Loot essential items and plan your escape carefully to ensure safety before time runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revive or Retreat:</strong> If you fall in battle, try to reclaim your lost gear or choose to extract safely at the factory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moderately Sized Maps:</strong> Explore dynamic environments filled with engaging PvE quests and random loot, keeping the experience fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Low-Poly World:</strong> Enjoy the unique visual appeal of a stylized low-poly landscape that enhances your adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to conquer, survive, and extract in <i>Landfall</i>! Join your friends in this action-packed journey and see if you have what it takes to thrive in a world where danger lurks around every corner!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2438270?t=1755204420","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2438270?t=1755204420","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/0049c99a18f2fd162758f76f309a39791d08b9c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755204420","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/0049c99a18f2fd162758f76f309a39791d08b9c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755204420","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Really small violence, no drug, a little alcool, no smoking."},"demos":[{"appid":2486060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/a40fc1fccdef903d3be312a162999794.avif?t=1755204420\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Landfall</i> is an exhilarating cooperative survival extraction game set in a vibrant low-poly world, where every decision counts and every moment is a test of your skills. Immerse yourself in a gameplay experience designed to be accessible to players of all skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/60437f75c12afab4ed8a30c4dd7635e6.poster.avif?t=1755204420\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/extras/60437f75c12afab4ed8a30c4dd7635e6.webm?t=1755204420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.a