ot essential items and plan your escape carefully to ensure safety before time runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revive or Retreat:</strong> If you fall in battle, try to reclaim your lost gear or choose to extract safely at the factory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moderately Sized Maps:</strong> Explore dynamic environments filled with engaging PvE quests and random loot, keeping the experience fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Low-Poly World:</strong> Enjoy the unique visual appeal of a stylized low-poly landscape that enhances your adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to conquer, survive, and extract in <i>Landfall</i>! Join your friends in this action-packed journey and see if you have what it takes to thrive in a world where danger lurks around every corner!</p>","developers":[" LastPulse Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438270/header.jpg?t=1755204420","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"All right reserve for MxzStudio","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2438270/760744/f88086ea79acb688c24f984eb33c44843f1b4184/1750919044/dash_av1.mpd?t=1727201108","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2438270/760744/f88086ea79acb688c24f984eb33c44843f1b4184/1750919044/dash_h264.mpd?t=1727201108","highlight":true,"hls_h26