cription":"Landfall is a thrilling low-poly co-op dungeon crawler and extraction game. Build and upgrade your base, trade with vendors, and team up to explore diverse maps, complete quests, gather loot, and defeat bosses. Gear up, survive, and thrive together in this unique low-poly PvE adventure.","steam_appid":2438270,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://discord.gg/cCUQzzRhbX"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}